      "text": "```\nKARL POPPER (1934, Logic of Scientific Discovery):\n  DEMARCATION: science = falsifiable claims; pseudo-science = unfalsifiable"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHILOSOPHY-OF-SCIENCE.md#013",
      "path": [
