      },
      "text": "GOOD SCIENCE:\n    Specific, testable predictions; clear conditions of refutation\n    Einsteinian relativity: predicts light bending; specific angle; testable 1919 eclipse\n    Darwin's evolution: predicts fossil record continuity; Cambrian explosion is anomaly to explain\n    Quantum mechanics: specific probability predictions; tested to 12 decimal places"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHILOSOPHY-OF-SCIENCE.md#016",
      "path": [
